---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="Crate Theory affiliate disclosure — how we make money and how it affects our reviews.">

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-cream uppercase tracking-tight mb-8">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-ct max-w-none">

      <p>
        Crate Theory participates in affiliate marketing programs. This means that when you click on certain links
        on this site and make a purchase, we may earn a commission — at no additional cost to you.
      </p>

      <h2>Programs We Participate In</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Amazon Associates</strong> — we earn from qualifying Amazon purchases</li>
        <li><strong>Commission Junction (CJ)</strong> — including Sweetwater, B&amp;H Photo, Guitar Center, and other music/audio retailers</li>
        <li><strong>Reverb</strong> — used gear marketplace affiliate program</li>
        <li>Other programs as relevant</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
      <p>
        Affiliate relationships do not influence our editorial content. We only recommend products we believe are
        genuinely useful. If we think something sucks, we say so. Commissions help keep the site running and the
        free downloads coming.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you have questions about our affiliate relationships, reach out via
        <a href="https://x.com/cratetheory">@cratetheory</a> on X.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>
